    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shattered_spire_note_1">Charred stone and melted glass for a hundred metres in every direction. Whatever happened here was catastrophic.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shattered_spire_note_2">A torn page from a research journal: \'The convergence experiment exceeds all projections. We must press on.\'</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shattered_spire_note_3">Arcane matrices etched into the surviving wall sections — a containment circle, poorly designed, clearly overstressed.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shattered_spire_note_4">A passage has been blasted open downward. Constructs still move in the dark below, following old instructions.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shattered_spire_note_5">The passage descends into intact chambers beneath the rubble. The Arcane Ruins still function, after a fashion.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_abyssal_lagoon_note_1">The water here has no bottom. Strange lights pulse from impossible depths.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_abyssal_lagoon_note_2">Fish pulled from the deep glow faintly and dissolve within minutes. What fed on them?</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_abyssal_lagoon_note_3">A torn map marks this lagoon with a single word: \'DO NOT FISH.\' No explanation is given.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_abyssal_lagoon_note_4">Something rises to the surface and sinks again. Massive. Ancient. Curious.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_abyssal_lagoon_note_5">The dark water parts. The Abyssal Ruins loom below — vast, alien, and ancient beyond reckoning.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_sunken_grotto_note_1">Strange stone pillars rise from the grotto floor, carved with script no living scholar can read.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_sunken_grotto_note_2">The fish scatter without warning — something large passes below.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_sunken_grotto_note_3">A waterlogged journal drifts by: \'The temple they found beneath the water was not abandoned. It was waiting.\'</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_sunken_grotto_note_4">A submerged archway pulses with faint ancient light. The current pulls toward it.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_sunken_grotto_note_5">The archway is clear. The Drowned Temple lies beyond — something old watches from within.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_dwarven_depths_note_1">Ancient rune-carved walls pulse faintly. The dwarves who built this place are long gone.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_dwarven_depths_note_2">A colossal forge stands at the passage end, its fires somehow still burning after centuries.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_dwarven_depths_note_3">Iron golems stand dormant in the alcoves. Their eyes flicker as you mine nearby.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_dwarven_depths_note_4">The forge runes are a warning — something was bound here, and it grows restless.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_dwarven_depths_note_5">The golems rise fully to life. The Ancient Forge awakens — its guardians await those brave enough to enter.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_corrupted_canopy_note_1">The trees here bleed shadow where cut. The wood writhes and resists the blade.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_corrupted_canopy_note_2">A shadow beast watches from the canopy. It does not attack — it only observes.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_corrupted_canopy_note_3">Old sanctum stones are visible through the twisted trunks. Something still lives there.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_corrupted_canopy_note_4">The corruption spreads as you work. The canopy hungers for something unnamed.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_corrupted_canopy_note_5">The canopy parts. The Corrupted Sanctum rises from the shadow-wood — its doors open, waiting.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_whispering_grove_note_1">The trees here whisper in a language older than any known tongue.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_whispering_grove_note_2">Stone foundations visible beneath the roots — the remains of something built long before the forest.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_whispering_grove_note_3">A druid\'s warning carved in bark: \'The clearing at the grove\'s heart is not what it was. Stay away.\'</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_whispering_grove_note_4">Corrupted vines reach toward you as you chop. The grove resists your presence.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_whispering_grove_note_5">A gap in the canopy reveals ruins at the grove\'s heart. The Ancient Forest Ruins call to be explored.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_thieves_den_note_1">A crumpled ledger page: names, dates, and numbers. Someone has been tracking payments to a person called the Warden.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_thieves_den_note_2">Scratched into the wall: \'For those who prove themselves — the Sanctum awaits. Ask no questions.\'</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_thieves_den_note_3">A torn letter warning a member to stay away from the eastern tunnels. No reason is given.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_thieves_den_note_4">A wax-sealed map fragment. The seal is unfamiliar — a shadow behind a locked door.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_thieves_den_note_5">The last passage opens into a vaulted chamber. At the far end, a reinforced door bears the same seal. The Rogue Sanctum lies beyond.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_crumbling_watchtower_note_1">Fresh rope marks on the windowsills. Someone uses this tower regularly.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_crumbling_watchtower_note_2">A hidden cache inside a cracked wall: lockpicks, a short blade, and a coded ledger.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_crumbling_watchtower_note_3">The ledger is a tally of stolen goods and split payments. The rogues operate out of somewhere beneath the hill.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_crumbling_watchtower_note_4">A trapdoor in the floor, recently oiled, its hinges silent. Worn boot prints surround it.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_crumbling_watchtower_note_5">The trapdoor opens onto a carved stairway going deep into the earth. The Shadow Den waits below.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_copper_caverns_note_1">Scratches mark the tunnel walls, too deep and wide for any pickaxe.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_copper_caverns_note_2">Old mining equipment, twisted and bent. Whatever was here left in a hurry.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_copper_caverns_note_3">A miner\'s torn note: \'We broke through to something below. The foreman sealed the lower shaft. He won\'t say why.\'</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_copper_caverns_note_4">Tremors from below. Dust falls from the ceiling in slow waves. Something stirs.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_copper_caverns_note_5">The sealed shaft gives way. A vast cavern opens beneath — the Collapsed Mine lies ahead.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shadow_vault_note_1">A dossier on every major merchant in the city. Someone has been compiling this for years.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shadow_vault_note_2">A vault door, partially ajar. Inside — crates of stolen weapons, armour, and sealed scroll cases.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shadow_vault_note_3">One scroll case is different from the others. It bears the seal of the royal treasury. It is empty.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shadow_vault_note_4">A private journal: \'The Guild of Shadows is not just a guild. It is a government. They have always been watching.\'</string> <!-- untranslated -->
    <string name="skilling_dungeon_shadow_vault_note_5">The deepest vault is not locked. It is guarded. What waits inside is the Guild\'s greatest secret — and its most dangerous protectors.</string> <!-- untranslated -->
